  Watchdog v2 push "等 DMIT 稳定后推": watchdog script is deployed via设备； pushing needs management channel; DMIT unstable but 66云 GIA fifth endpoint and Guangzhou are available paths. The dependency on DMIT stability is questionable; user asked "先修". Also watchdog v2 probing 18443-18447: after endpoint switch to Guangzhou as primary with MGMT_LOCAL_PORT 18443, ports still 18443-18447. Fine. But caution: watchdog restarts mgmt-tunnel only when ALL probes fail — that's the right conservative semantics. One caveat: probe uses https://127.0.0.1:18443/api/v1/health — the health endpoint exists on the mgmt API behind the -L target. On Guangzhou, gz-mgmt serves 8443 with /api/v1/health? Credential doc says "管理 8443 健康端点已运行" presumably same API. OK.

